            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Katonda wa buggya era Mukama awalana eggwanga.\n    Mukama awalana eggwanga era ajudde ekiruyi.\n  Mukama yeesasuza ku balabe be\n    era aterekera abamuwakanya obusungu bwe.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a547e4909dcafd44eaa",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Mukama tatera kusunguwala, ate nga wa maanyi mangi\n    era tayinza n’akatono butabonereza oyo gwe gusinze.\n  Ekkubo lye liri mu mpewo ey’akazimu ne mu kibuyaga,\n    n’ebire ye nfuufu y’ebigere bye.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a547e4909dcafd44ee7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Akangavvula ennyanja n’agikaza\n    era akaza emigga gyonna,\n  ennimiro ez’omu Basani zikala, olusozi Kalumeeri lwonna lukayuse,\n    n’ebimuli bya Lebanooni biwotose.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a547e4909dcafd44f2d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Ensozi zikankanira mu maaso ga Katonda,\n    obusozi ne busaanuuka,\n  ettaka ne lyatikayatika mu maaso ge,\n    ensi n’ekankana n’abantu bonna abagirimu.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd44f77",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Ani ayinza okuyimirira mu maaso ge ng’asunguwadde?\n    Ani ayinza okugumira obusungu bwe obw’amaanyi?\n  Ekiruyi kye kibuubuuka ng’omuliro,\n    n’enjazi n’eziyatikayatika.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd44fcd",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Mukama mulungi,\n    kiddukiro mu kiseera eky’okulabiramu ennaku,\n  era alabirira abo bonna abamwesiga.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd44ffa",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Naye alisaanyaawo abalabe be mu mataba amazibu,\n  ekizikiza kiribawondera.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd45025",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Buli kye mwekobaana okukola Mukama,\n    alikikomya.\n    Akabi tekalijja mulundi gwakubiri.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd4504e",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Kubanga baliba ng’amaggwa agakwataganye,\n    era nga batamidde,\n    balyoke bookebwe omuliro ng’ekisambu ekikalu.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd4508c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Mu ggwe Nineeve muvuddemu omuntu\n    alowooza akabi\n    era ateesa ebibi ku Mukama.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd450c1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Bw’ati bw’ayogera Mukama nti,\n  “Newaakubadde nga balina be bakolagana nabo bangi, ate nga bangi,\n    balizikirizibwa ne baggwaawo.\n  Newaakubadde nga mbabonereza mmwe abantu bange,\n    siriddayo kukikola nate.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd45123",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Kaakano nzija kumenya ekikoligo kyabwe nkibaggyeko\n    era n’ebibasibye nnaabikutulakutula.”",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd451cf",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Kino Mukama ky’alagidde ekikwata ku Nineeve:\n    “Erinnya lyo terikyayala nate.\n  Ndizikiriza ekifaananyi ekyole n’ekifaananyi ekisaanuuse\n    ebiri mu masabo g’abakatonda bo;\n  ndisima entaana yo\n    kubanga oyinze obugwagwa.”",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a557e4909dcafd45228",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc40",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.1",
        "content": "Yimusa amaaso, tunula ku nsozi, laba,\n    ebigere ebirungi eby’oyo aleese amawulire amalungi,\n    alangirira emirembe.\n  Ggwe Yuda kwata embaga zo entukuvu,\n    era otuukirize obweyamo bwo;\n  omubi kaakano takyakulumba,\n    azikiririzibbwa ddala, tolimulaba nate.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45394",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Nineeve, olumbiddwa omulabe;\n    kuuma ekigo,\n    Kuuma ekkubo,\n    weesibire ddala onywere mu kiwato,\n    kuŋŋaanya amaanyi go gonna.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd453ba",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Kubanga Mukama alizzaawo ekitiibwa kya Yakobo,\n    kibe ng’ekitiibwa kya Isirayiri,\n  newaakubadde ng’abazikiriza baabasaanyawo,\n    ne boonoona emizabbibu gyabwe.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd453f0",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Engabo z’eggye erikutabadde zonna myufu\n    n’engoye ze bambadde nazo bwe zityo.\n  Amagaali g’ebyuuma gamasamasa\n    ku lunaku lwe gategekebwa,\n    era n’amafumu gagalulwa mu ngeri ey’entiisa!",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd4540f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Amagaali g’abalwanyi gatayira mu nguudo,\n    gadda eno n’eri,\n  galabika ng’emimuli egyaka,\n    gamyansa ng’eggulu.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45436",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Omuduumizi bw’ayita abalwanyi be\n    bajja bagwirana.\n  Badduka mbiro ku bbugwe w’ekibuga\n    we beetegekera okwerwanako.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd454ac",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Enzigi ez’omugga zigguddwawo,\n    amazzi ne gasaanyaawo olubiri.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
