            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Etteeka lyayisibwa ku kibuga\n    nti kiriwaŋŋangusibwa,\n  abaddu abakazi bakungubaga ng’amayiba,\n    nga bwe beekuba mu bifuba.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45552",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Ab’omu Nineeve bafaanana ng’ekidiba\n    eky’amazzi agakalira.\n  Wadde nga babakoowoola nti, “Muyimirire, muyimirire!”\n    bo beeyongerayo bweyongezi.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd455ac",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Ffeeza yaakyo temugirekaawo,\n    ne zaabu nayo mugitwalire ddala,\n  omunyago teguggwaayo,\n    eby’obugagga byakyo ebitabalika ebirungi ddala.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45627",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Ekibuga kisigadde kyangaala!\n    Abantu bonna emitima gibeewanise, emibiri gibakankana,\n    amaviivi gabakubagana, basiiwuuse ne mu maaso.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45680",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Eri ludda wa empuku y’empologoma,\n    ekifo we ziriisiza empologoma zaazo ento,\n  empologoma ensajja, n’enkazi,\n    n’ento we zaatambuliranga nga tewali kizikanga?",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd45691",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "Empologoma ensajja yayigganga ennyama y’abaana ebamala,\n    n’enkazi n’ezittira eyaazo,\n  n’ejjuza empuku n’omuyiggo,\n    ne mu bisulo ne mujjula ennyama.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a567e4909dcafd456c7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cc92",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.2",
        "content": "“Laba nze Mukama ow’Eggye\n    nkwolekedde,\n  era ndyokya amagaali go gonna ne ganyooka,\n    n’ekitala kirizikiriza empologoma zo ento.\n    Era tolifuna munyago mulala nate ku nsi,\n  n’eddoboozi ly’ababaka bo\n    teririddayo kuwulirwa.”",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45818",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Zikusanze ggwe ekibuga eky’omusaayi!\n    Kyonna ekijjudde eby’obulimba\n  n’obunyazi,\n    ekitaggwaamu banyagiddwa.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd4587c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Muwulire okuvuga kw’embooko,\n    n’okuvuuma kwa namuziga z’amagaali\n  n’ebigere by’embalaasi nga bwe bivuga\n    n’amagaali nga gakubaganira mu nguudo!",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd458bf",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Laba eggye ery’embalaasi erirumba,\n    n’ebitala ebitemagana,\n    n’amafumu agamyansa.\n  Abatuukiddwako ebisago nga bayitirivu,\n    ne ntuumu ennene ez’emirambo\n  egitamanyiddwa muwendo;\n    abantu bagirinnyirira.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45934",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Bino byonna biri bityo kubanga Nineeve yeeweerayo ddala okwetunda eri abalabe ba Katonda obutasalako, nga malaaya omukulu,\n    kye kibuga ekikyaamu ekitali kyesigwa ekyawubisa ebirala, omukulu w’obufumu,\n  ekyafuula amawanga abaddu baakyo olw’obwamalaaya bwakyo,\n    n’olw’obulogo bwakyo.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd459a1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "“Laba nkwolekedde,” bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye,\n    “era nditikka engoye zo ne zidda ku mutwe gwo.\n  Ensi zonna ziriraba obwereere bwo\n    n’obwakabaka bwonna bulabe ensonyi zo.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45a1a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Ndikukanyugira kazambi,\n    era ndikufuula ekyenyinyalwa\n    ne nkufuula eky’okwelolera.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45a82",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Awo bonna abalikutunuulira balikwesamba ne bagamba nti,\n    ‘Nineeve kifuuse matongo, ani anakikungubagira?’\n    Abalikikubagiza baliva wa?”",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45aa9",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Ggwe Nineeve ggw’osinga Tebesi\n    ekyali kizimbiddwa ku mugga Kiyira\n    ng’amazzi gakyetoolodde okukikuuma ku njuyi zonna?\n  Olukomera lwakyo gwali mugga\n    era amazzi ge gaali bbugwe waakyo.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45add",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Esiyopya ne Misiri ze zaakiwagiranga.\n    Ate nga Abapuuti n’ab’omu Libiya nabo nga bakiyamba.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45b04",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Kyawambibwa, ne kitwalibwa mu buwaŋŋanguse.\n    Abaana bwakyo abawere babetentebwa mu ntandikwa ya buli luguudo.\n  Abakungu baakyo baakubirwa obululu,\n    n’abasajja be ab’amaanyi baasibibwa mu njegere.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a577e4909dcafd45b33",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Nineeve naawe olitamiira,\n    olyekweka\n    ng’onoonya obuddukiro owone omulabe wo.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a587e4909dcafd45b78",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Ebigo byo byonna biri ng’emitiini\n    egiriko ebibala ebisooka okwengera;\n  bwe ginyeenyezebwa\n    ne bigwa mu kamwa k’oyo anaabirya.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a587e4909dcafd45ba1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Laba abalwanyi bammwe balinafuwa\n    ne batiitiira ng’abakazi.\n  Enzigi z’ensi yo\n    nzigule eri abalabe bo.\n    Era omuliro gwokezza emikiikiro gyazo.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a587e4909dcafd45bb5",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
        "content": "Weenyweze bajja kukulumba!\n    Weeterekere ku mazzi g’onoonywako.\n  Nyweza ebisenge byo.\n    Noonya ettaka olisambe\n    oddaabirize ekisenge eky’amatoffaali.",
        "reference": "Nakkumu 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/NAM/NAM.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a587e4909dcafd45be5",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "NAM.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "NAM",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ccc8",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "NAM",
            "id": "NAM.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3cbdd"
        },
        "chapterId": "NAM.3",
